{"step_index":89,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:59:23Z","thinking":"**Planning HTML Page Creation**\n\nExamining the required HTML pages for the client-side application. The identified pages cover key functionalities like home, verification, details display, price checking, pharmacy location and details, login, registration (both customer and pharmacy), and a customer dashboard. The next step is creating these pages.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>MedCheck BD - Verify. Compare. Find. Stay Safe.</title>\n  <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <!-- Font Awesome 6 Icons -->\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <!-- Custom CSS -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main>\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n      <div class=\"container position-relative\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center g-5\">\n          <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n            <span class=\"badge bg-success bg-opacity-25 text-white border border-success border-opacity-50 px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mb-3\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-shield-heart me-1\"></i> Bangladesh Healthcare Security Platform\n            </span>\n            <h1 class=\"hero-title mb-3\">\n              Know Your Medicine <br><span style=\"color: #38bdf8;\">Before You Buy.</span>\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"hero-subtitle mb-4\">\n              Verify medicine information, check official reference prices, locate nearby verified pharmacies, and maintain a secure digital medicine history in one unified platform.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n              <a href=\"verify.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-lg px-4 shadow\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-shield-check me-2\"></i>Verify Medicine\n              </a>\n              <a href=\"pharmacies.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt me-2\"></i>Find Pharmacy\n              </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Quick Stats -->\n            <div class=\"row mt-5 pt-3 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25 g-3\">\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-white mb-0\">20+</h3>\n                <small class=\"text-secondary\">Reference Medicines</small>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-white mb-0\">10+</h3>\n                <small class=\"text-secondary\">Verified BD Pharmacies</small>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-white mb-0\">100%</h3>\n                <small class=\"text-secondary\">DGDA Price Transparency</small>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Hero Right Graphic / Shield Card -->\n          <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n            <div class=\"hero-card-illustration\">\n              <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"brand-icon\" style=\"width: 48px; height: 48px; font-size: 1.5rem;\">\n                  <i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <h5 class=\"mb-0 text-white fw-bold\">MedCheck BD Guard</h5>\n                  <small class=\"text-white-50\">Live Reference Verification</small>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Interactive Quick Search Bar in Hero -->\n              <form action=\"verify.html\" method=\"GET\" class=\"mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\n                  <input type=\"text\" name=\"query\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Napa, Seclo, DAR-012...\" style=\"border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;\">\n                  <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom\" type=\"submit\" style=\"border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </form>\n\n              <!-- Sample pill card illustration -->\n              <div class=\"p-3 bg-white bg-opacity-10 rounded-3 mb-3 border border-white border-opacity-10\">\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2\">\n                  <span class=\"fw-bold text-white\">Napa 500 mg (Beximco)</span>\n                  <span class=\"status-pill match small py-1 px-2\">DATABASE MATCH ✓</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between small text-white-50\">\n                  <span>Batch: NAPA-2026-01</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-white fw-bold\">Ref: ৳1.20</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"p-3 bg-white bg-opacity-10 rounded-3 border border-white border-opacity-10\">\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2\">\n                  <span class=\"fw-bold text-white\">MedCare Pharmacy</span>\n                  <span class=\"status-pill verified small py-1 px-2\">VERIFIED PHARMACY</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"small text-white-50\">\n                  <i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt text-danger me-1\"></i> Dhanmondi, Dhaka • In Stock\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Four Feature Cards -->\n    <section class=\"py-5\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\n          <span class=\"text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase small\">Core Ecosystem</span>\n          <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Connecting Customer, Pharmacy & Regulators</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-muted\">A modern solution tailored for the Bangladeshi medicine supply chain.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n            <div class=\"feature-box\">\n              <div class=\"feature-icon-wrapper bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-check-shield\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\">1. Medicine Verification</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small mb-3\">\n                Verify brand names, generics, DAR registration status, and batch expiry data against verified reference records.\n              </p>\n              <a href=\"verify.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary text-decoration-none small\">\n                Verify Now <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ms-1\"></i>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n            <div class=\"feature-box\">\n              <div class=\"feature-icon-wrapper bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\">2. Price Check</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small mb-3\">\n                Compare pharmacy prices with DGDA reference benchmark prices. Spot overpricing with green/red variance badges.\n              </p>\n              <a href=\"price.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-success text-decoration-none small\">\n                Check Prices <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ms-1\"></i>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n            <div class=\"feature-box\">\n              <div class=\"feature-icon-wrapper bg-info bg-opacity-10 text-info\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-store\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\">3. Pharmacy Availability</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small mb-3\">\n                Search verified pharmacies by Dhanmondi, Mirpur, Uttara, Chittagong, etc., and check real-time stock availability.\n              </p>\n              <a href=\"pharmacies.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-info text-decoration-none small\">\n                Locate Stores <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ms-1\"></i>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n            <div class=\"feature-box\">\n              <div class=\"feature-icon-wrapper bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-history\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\">4. Medicine History</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small mb-3\">\n                Maintain a digital ledger of verified medicines and digital purchase receipts for your family's healthcare safety.\n              </p>\n              <a href=\"history.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-warning text-decoration-none small\">\n                View History <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ms-1\"></i>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- How MedCheck BD Works -->\n    <section class=\"py-5 bg-white border-top border-bottom\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\n          <span class=\"text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase small\">Simple & Transparent</span>\n          <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">How MedCheck BD Works</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-muted\">Four quick steps to safeguard your medicine purchases.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"p-4\">\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3\" style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold;\">\n                1\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Search or Scan</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small\">\n                Enter medicine name, DAR registration number, batch code, or scan the package barcode.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"p-4\">\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3\" style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold;\">\n                2\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Check Information</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small\">\n                Inspect manufacturer details, dosage, batch manufacturing/expiry dates, and alert notices.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"p-4\">\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3\" style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold;\">\n                3\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Compare Price</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small\">\n                Examine price variances across licensed pharmacies to avoid paying inflated retail rates.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"p-4\">\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3\" style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold;\">\n                4\n              </div>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Find Nearby Pharmacy</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted small\">\n                Find licensed and verified pharmacies near your neighborhood with ready stock and contact them.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Why MedCheck BD? -->\n    <section class=\"py-5\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center g-5\">\n          <div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n            <span class=\"text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase small\">Healthcare Integrity</span>\n            <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-4\">Why MedCheck BD?</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"text-success fs-5\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\">Verified Pharmacy Information</h6>\n                <p class=\"text-muted small\">Only pharmacies with authenticated DGDA drug licenses receive the Verified Pharmacy badge.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"text-success fs-5\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\">Comprehensive Medicine Database</h6>\n                <p class=\"text-muted small\">Standardized profiles for Bangladesh's top pharmaceutical manufacturers: Beximco, Square, Incepta, Renata, Opsonin.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"text-success fs-5\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\">Batch and Expiry Tracking</h6>\n                <p class=\"text-muted small\">Automated warnings for medicines nearing expiry (60 days) or already expired.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"text-success fs-5\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\">Price Reference & Fair Rates</h6>\n                <p class=\"text-muted small\">Empowering patients with official reference price data so they never overpay.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"text-success fs-5\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\">Medicine Alerts & Recall Notices</h6>\n                <p class=\"text-muted small\">Instant warnings when an adverse batch or packaging defect is reported in the community.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start gap-3\">\n              <div class=\"text-success fs-5\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\">Digital Purchase History</h6>\n                <p class=\"text-muted small\">Receipt generation for transparent sales audit trails and personal medical record keeping.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n            <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white\">\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-virus text-primary me-2\"></i>Official Public Disclaimer</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-secondary small leading-relaxed\">\n                MedCheck BD provides database and reference information. Users should verify medicines and prescriptions with licensed healthcare professionals and official authorities when necessary.\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"text-secondary small leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                Medicine authenticity is represented as <strong>“Verification Status / Database Match / Alert Information”</strong>, not guaranteed physical chemical testing. All reference prices and registration codes are sourced from public Bangladesh DGDA benchmarks and realistic demo reference records.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n                <a href=\"verify.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\">Start Verification</a>\n                <a href=\"report.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm\">Report Discrepancy</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Bootstrap 5 JS Bundle -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <!-- Global Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Home page (index.html) with hero, features, workflow, and disclaimer","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\index.html","toolAction":"Create client/index.html","toolSummary":"Create index.html"}}]}
