{"step_index":91,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:59:36Z","thinking":"**Designing the Medicine Verification UI**\n\nPlanning the structure of `client/verify.html`. The main heading will be \"Medicine Verification.\" A search input field will allow entry of medicine details. Buttons are required for searching and barcode scanning. Quick demo pill tags should facilitate user interaction, and a result card displaying verification status is also needed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Medicine Verification - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Page Header -->\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-700 mx-auto mb-5\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mb-2\">\n          <i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt me-1\"></i> Reference Database Lookup\n        </span>\n        <h1 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Medicine Verification</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-muted\">\n          Cross-reference medicine brand, generic composition, manufacturer DAR registration number, batch status, or barcode against official records.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Search Card -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 p-md-5 mb-5 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 860px;\">\n        <form onsubmit=\"handleVerifySubmit(event)\">\n     